 rm fellowships of up to USD 23\,000 for 4 to 12 months\; short-term grants
  of up to USD 5\,000 for 1 to 3 months. In 2026\, 31 American Fellows rece
 ived over USD 277\,390 in total funding. Awards are given in all fields\, 
 including creative arts projects.\nDuration: 1 to 3 months (grants) or 4 t
 o 12 months (fellowships)\; year-long fellows submit an interim report\, a
 nd all fellows submit a final narrative report within 60 days of the fello
 wship's end.\n\nMore: https://www.amscan.org/fellowships-grants/grants-and
 -awards-for-americans/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
