 small cultural organisations doing participatory\, socially engaged or civ
 ic-media work in Germany.\n\nOrganisation: Fonds Soziokultur\nLocation: Ge
 rmany. Projects must take place in Germany\; applicant groups need at leas
 t three members resident in Germany.\nAward: EUR 5\,000 to EUR 30\,000 per
  project\, covering at most 80 percent of the total project budget. No app
 lication fee.\nDuration: Project-length\; funded projects can start from F
 ebruary 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.fonds-soziokultur.de/en/projectfunding/
 overview?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
