  small to mid-scale arts festivals whose programmes engage local communiti
 es or communities of interest\, across all artforms including multidiscipl
 inary\, digital and performance programmes. Round 2 of the 2027 scheme is 
 for festivals later in 2027 (Round 1\, which closed in May 2026\, covered 
 festivals from January to June 2027).\n\nOrganisation: Arts Council of Ire
 land / An Chomhairle Ealaion\nLocation: Republic of Ireland. For organisat
 ions delivering arts festivals in Ireland.\nAward: Up to EUR 45\,000 per f
 estival. Round 1 used three bands: Band A up to EUR 10\,000\, Band B EUR 1
 0\,001 to 25\,000\, Band C EUR 25\,001 to 45\,000. No application fee.\nDu
 ration: Round 2 covers festivals taking place in the second half of 2027 (
 Round 1 covered 1 January to 30 June 2027\; confirm exact dates in the Rou
 nd 2 guidelines). Opened 20 October 2026.\n\nMore: https://www.artscouncil
 .ie/funding-opportunities/festivals-investment-scheme-round-2/?utm_source=
