 jects.\n\nOrganisation: Creative Europe MEDIA (European Commission / EACEA
 )\nLocation: EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated to Creative E
 urope MEDIA. For organisations (legal entities) established in a MEDIA cou
 ntry\; natural persons cannot apply. Single established independent produc
 tion company.\nAward: EUR 90\,000 to EUR 510\,000 per slate\, built from f
 ixed lump sums per project type (for example EUR 30\,000 for a one-off cre
 ative documentary\, EUR 60\,000 for an animated series\, EUR 75\,000 for a
  fiction series budgeted EUR 5-20 million). Total call budget EUR 22\,374\
 ,320. No application fee.\nDuration: Projects normally up to 36 months. Ca
 ll opened 30 September 2026.\n\nMore: https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-te
